| class | x |
| :--- | ---: |
| A | -2 |
| B | 2 |

| actual query x | actual selected class | actual P(A) | actual P(B) |
| ---: | --- | ---: | ---: |
| -1 | A | 0.982013790038 | 0.017986209962 |
| 0 | A | 0.500000000000 | 0.500000000000 |
| 1 | B | 0.017986209962 | 0.982013790038 |
